    (R.cV i).ρ x⁻¹ (Ad.eW D.what₂.mu0 (reference_tuple_used D) i ((Fm : Formalism.AUTREP.GAf D.host.E D.R.nV → (M D.what₂.mu0 (i.1 + 1) (by omega) (by omega)).wt.W)
